2026-11-10T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2489) 'The base model is the reference body mesh, the static rig everything hangs from. It must be measured so garments fit it and the net can be checked. Hand-measured numbers are the only source today and they do not round-trip to the mesh.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2489  1 LINE
 Text:Written

